<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#4b1022">
<title>Para Carla ❤️</title>
<style>
  :root { --wine:#64152f; --deep:#210b16; --cream:#f5e5c8; --gold:#d8ad69; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  body {
    margin:0; min-height:100vh; color:var(--cream);
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 18% 12%, rgba(171,93,57,.25), transparent 34%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 80%, rgba(102,26,54,.38), transparent 38%),
      linear-gradient(145deg,#160910,#35101f 55%,#190a13);
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  .grain { position:fixed; inset:0; pointer-events:none; opacity:.12; z-index:0;
    background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.28'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"); }
  main { position:relative; z-index:1; width:min(900px,92%); margin:auto; padding:54px 0 70px; text-align:center; }
  .eyebrow { color:var(--gold); letter-spacing:.28em; text-transform:uppercase; font:12px Arial,sans-serif; }
  h1 { font-size:clamp(42px,9vw,82px); font-weight:normal; margin:18px 0 10px; color:#f4d9b1; text-shadow:0 4px 25px #8c2947; }
  .subtitle { font-style:italic; color:#e4c6b7; font-size:clamp(17px,3vw,21px); }
  .flower-art { width:min(390px,85vw); margin:28px auto 24px; filter:drop-shadow(0 12px 22px #080308); }
  .panel { width:min(650px,100%); margin:28px auto; padding:28px 24px; border:1px solid rgba(216,173,105,.5);
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(84,17,39,.75),rgba(32,9,21,.86)); box-shadow:0 18px 55px #08030880; border-radius:5px; }
  .panel h2 { color:var(--gold); font-weight:normal; font-size:27px; margin:0 0 12px; }
  .panel p { line-height:1.75; color:#f0dfd0; font-size:17px; }
  button { border:1px solid var(--gold); background:#711c39; color:#fff0dc; padding:13px 23px; border-radius:3px; font:15px Georgia,serif; cursor:pointer; transition:.2s; }
  button:hover { background:#8b2949; transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .letter { display:none; text-align:left; animation:appear .7s ease; }
  .letter.open { display:block; }
  .letter p { white-space:pre-line; }
  .music-note { color:#d8b7a8; font-size:14px; margin-top:12px; }
  footer { color:#b98b85; font-size:13px; margin-top:42px; font-style:italic; }
  @keyframes appear { from {opacity:0; transform:translateY(10px)} to {opacity:1; transform:translateY(0)} }
  @media(max-width:520px){ main{padding-top:38px}.panel{padding:23px 18px} }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="grain"></div>
<main>
  <div class="eyebrow">Uma pequena surpresa feita com carinho</div>
  <h1>Carla</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">“Fiz um pequeno universo só para você.”</div>

  <svg class="flower-art" viewBox="0 0 420 330" role="img" aria-label="Ilustração artística de flores em tons dourados e vinho">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="petal" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#f3c76d"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#c87937"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#7c293d"/></linearGradient>
      <linearGradient id="leaf" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#8e9b54"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#284d3d"/></linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path d="M207 310 C195 240 218 170 201 95 M205 242 C150 202 118 207 82 180 M207 215 C270 170 300 166 340 145" fill="none" stroke="#66804e" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M194 251 C143 211 117 218 92 193 C137 185 173 202 194 251Z" fill="url(#leaf)" stroke="#c0a15b" stroke-width="2"/>
    <path d="M217 223 C268 174 302 181 330 154 C319 202 275 224 217 223Z" fill="url(#leaf)" stroke="#c0a15b" stroke-width="2"/>
    <g transform="translate(203 88)">
      <g fill="url(#petal)" stroke="#f1c878" stroke-width="2">
        <ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(30)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(60)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(90)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(120)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(150)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(180)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(210)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(240)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(270)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(300)"/><ellipse cy="-48" rx="20" ry="43" transform="rotate(330)"/>
      </g>
      <circle r="29" fill="#54202c" stroke="#e0ad58" stroke-width="5"/>
      <circle r="18" fill="#9c5a35"/><g fill="#e5b75c"><circle cx="-8" cy="-5" r="3"/><circle cx="7" cy="-10" r="3"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="3"/><circle cx="-7" cy="10" r="3"/><circle r="3"/></g>
    </g>
    <g transform="translate(83 179) scale(.55)">
      <g fill="#9d3d50" stroke="#e4a36b" stroke-width="3"><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(45)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(90)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(135)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(180)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(225)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(270)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(315)"/></g><circle r="19" fill="#d5a34f"/>
    </g>
    <g transform="translate(339 143) scale(.48)">
      <g fill="#a54a56" stroke="#e4b46c" stroke-width="3"><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(45)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(90)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(135)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(180)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(225)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(270)"/><ellipse cy="-38" rx="18" ry="35" transform="rotate(315)"/></g><circle r="19" fill="#d5a34f"/>
    </g>
    <path d="M150 304 Q208 280 267 304" fill="none" stroke="#d4a35c" stroke-width="3" opacity=".8"/>
  </svg>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Uma surpresa para você</h2>
    <p>Tem coisas que merecem ser feitas com calma, carinho e um pouco de poesia.</p>
    <button id="letterButton" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Abrir minha carta ❤️</button>
    <div class="letter" id="letter">
      <p><em>Minha carta para você ainda está sendo escrita...</em>

Este espaço vai guardar suas palavras, do jeitinho que você quiser.</p>
      <p style="text-align:right;color:#d8ad69">Com carinho, Gustavo</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Uma música para acompanhar</h2>
    <p>Escolha uma música que tenha significado para vocês. Ela poderá tocar aqui quando adicionarmos o link ou arquivo.</p>
    <button type="button" id="musicButton">♪ Música em breve</button>
    <div class="music-note" id="musicNote">A música ainda será escolhida.</div>
  </section>
  <footer>Feito especialmente para Carla · com carinho, Gustavo</footer>
</main>
<script>
  const letterButton = document.getElementById('letterButton');
  const letter = document.getElementById('letter');
  letterButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const isOpen = letter.classList.toggle('open');
    letterButton.textContent = isOpen ? 'Fechar minha carta' : 'Abrir minha carta ❤️';
    letterButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(isOpen));
  });
  document.getElementById('musicButton').addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.getElementById('musicNote').textContent = 'Em breve vamos colocar a música escolhida por você aqui. ❤️';
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
